==== Opening/closing the case ====
6x Torx (T-8) screws.  Four of which are under the rubber feet.

=== Putting it back together ===
  - Place board component-side up on lower chassis, aligning holes with plastic pegs.
  - Position rear bezel around buttons and LAN ports, fitting into slot in lower chassis.
  - Hold clear wraparound bezel on upper chassis, and place onto lower chassis and board.  Make sure rear bezel fits into slot in upper chassis.
  - Replace Torx screws and rubber feet.
