How to connect to Serial Port:

The device uses TTL @ 3.3V.
Bits per second: **115200**\\
Data bits: **8**\\
Parity: **None**\\
Stop bits: **1**\\
Flow control: **None**\\

Serial Connector:  JP2, pin 1 marked with dot.
JP2 Pinout: (1) Vcc (3.3 V), (2) TX (from Router), (3) RX (to Router), (4) GND\\
